    "kind": "claim",
    "system": 43,
    "layer": "natal",
    "claim": "你重眼前的實際回報；你的決絕有時並非先出手，而是付出之後得不到應有的回應，才一下子斷然放手。",
    "en": "You weigh the return in front of you; your hard cuts are sometimes not the first move: they come after you have given and got nothing back, and then you end it at once.",
    "limit": "有情無情只就紫相本身比較；原文說無情並非一定等於薄情。",
